unavailable-subtitle: We have a coalition agreement keeping this position fixed.

[?if finance_minister != "Vacant" : Who should we replace [+ finance_minister +] with? ?][?if finance_minister == "Vacant" : Who should we appoint to the position? ?]

- #finance_candidates
- @keep_finance

